    "Audio hardware properties could not be read" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "无法读取音频硬件属性" } } } },
    "No audio devices were reported" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "系统未报告音频设备" } } } },
    "One or more Core Audio properties were unavailable or invalid and were omitted." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "一个或多个 Core Audio 属性不可用或无效，已省略。" } } } },
    "Core Audio device handles are used only inside one read and are never stored or exported." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Core Audio 设备句柄仅在单次读取内部使用，绝不保存或导出。" } } } },
    "Device UID, model UID, name, manufacturer, icon, clock domain, and free-form driver text are not read." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "不读取设备 UID、型号 UID、名称、厂商、图标、时钟域或驱动自由文本。" } } } },
    "This provider only queries hardware properties; it does not open an audio stream, capture samples, record audio, or request microphone permission." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "此 Provider 只查询硬件属性；不会打开音频流、采集样本、录音或请求麦克风权限。" } } } },
    "Nominal sample rate is the device's current configured rate; device latency excludes additional stream and safety-offset latency." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "标称采样率是设备当前配置的速率；设备延迟不含额外的流延迟与安全偏移延迟。" } } } },
    "%lld devices • %lld input • %lld output" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%lld 台设备 • %lld 台支持输入 • %lld 台支持输出" } } } },
