    "System disk does not expose NVMe SMART" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "系统磁盘未提供 NVMe SMART" } } } },
    "NVMe SMART interface was unavailable" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "NVMe SMART 接口不可用" } } } },
    "NVMe SMART access was denied" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "NVMe SMART 访问被拒绝" } } } },
    "NVMe SMART device was temporarily unavailable" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "NVMe SMART 设备暂时不可用" } } } },
    "NVMe SMART read failed" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "NVMe SMART 读取失败" } } } },
    "No recognized warning bit is not a complete health assessment." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "没有已识别的警告位并不等于完整的健康评估。" } } } },
    "Percentage used is a controller lifetime-use estimate; 100% does not mean failure and the value can exceed 100%." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "已用百分比是控制器给出的寿命消耗估算；100% 不表示故障，数值也可能超过 100%。" } } } },
    "Composite temperature describes the controller and NVM, not room temperature." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "综合温度描述控制器与 NVM，并非室温。" } } } },
    "Data units are rounded up in groups of 1,000 × 512-byte units; converted counter bytes are exact for the reported unit count, not exact historical I/O bytes." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "数据单元按 1,000 × 512 字节为一组向上取整；换算的计数字节值对报告单元数是精确的，但不是精确的历史 I/O 字节数。" } } } },
    "Unsafe shutdowns and media errors are controller-reported cumulative facts, not attribution or failure predictions." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "非正常关机与介质错误是控制器报告的累计事实，不用于归因或预测故障。" } } } },
    "Only SMARTReadData for the current system-volume whole disk is used; identify data, device names, serial numbers, paths, and detailed error logs are not read." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "仅使用当前系统卷整盘的 SMARTReadData；不读取 identify 数据、设备名称、序列号、路径或详细错误日志。" } } } },
    "One or more scalar fields failed validation and were omitted." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "一个或多个标量字段未通过校验，已省略。" } } } },
    "One or more counter-byte conversions exceeded UInt128 and were omitted; raw counters remain available." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "一个或多个计数字节换算超出 UInt128，已省略；原始计数仍可用。" } } } },
    "No device identifier or system error text is exported." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "不导出设备标识符或系统错误文本。" } } } },
